EST" OR THE "COMPANY") (NYSE: LUV) OF A CLASS ACTION SECURITIES LAWSUIT.THE LAWSUIT ON BEHALF OF SOUTHWEST INVESTORS HAS BEEN COMMENCED IN THE THE UNITED STATES DISTRICT COURT FOR THE SOUTHERN DISTRICT OF TEXAS. AFFECTED INVESTORS PURCHASED OR OTHERWISE ACQUIRED CERTAIN SOUTHWEST AIRLINES CO. SECURITIES BETWEEN JUNE 13, 2020 AND DECEMBER 31, 2022.'}{'symbol': 'LUV', 'date': '2023-02-08 12:30:00', 'title': 'SOUTHWEST AIRLINES CO. (NYSE: LUV) SHAREHOLDER CLASS ACTION ALERT: BERNSTEIN LIEBHARD LLP REMINDS INVESTORS OF THE DEADLINE TO FILE A LEAD PLAINTIFF MOTION IN A SECURITIES CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT AGAINST SOUTHWEST AIRLINES CO. (NYSE: LUV)', 'text': 'DID YOU LOSE MONEY ON INVESTMENTS IN SOUTHWEST AIRLINES?\xa0 IF SO, PLEASE VISIT\xa0SOUTHWEST AIRLINES CO. SHAREHOLDER CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT\xa0OR CONTACT\xa0 JOSEPH R.'}{'symbol': 'STE', 'date': '2023-02-08 16:30:00', 'title': 'STERIS ANNOUNCES FINANCIAL RESULTS FOR FISCAL 2023 THIRD QUARTER', 'text': 'DUBLIN, IRELAND, FEB. 08, 2023 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- \xa0STERIS PLC (NYSE: STE) (“STERIS” OR THE “COMPANY”) TODAY ANNOUNCED FINANCIAL RESULTS FOR ITS FISCAL 2023 THIRD QUARTER ENDED DECEMBER 31, 2022. REVENUE AS REPORTED FOR THE QUARTER INCREASED 1% TO $1.22 BILLION COMPARED WITH $1.21 BILLION IN THE THIRD QUARTER OF FISCAL 2022. CONSTANT CURRENCY ORGANIC REVENUE (SEE NON-GAAP FINANCIAL MEASURES) INCREASED 7% FOR THE THIRD QUARTER OF FISCAL 2023 AS COMPARED TO THE THIRD QUARTER OF FISCAL 2022.'}{'symbol': 'TMUS', 'date': '2023-02-08 09:04:00', 'title': 'T-MOBILE FURTHER BREAKS DOWN BARRIERS TO HIGH-SPEED INTERNET BY EXPANDING PARTICIPATION IN FEDERAL AFFORDABLE CONNECTIVITY PROGRAM', 'text': "BELLEVUE, WASH.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--TO ENSURE FINANCIALLY CHALLENGED HOUSEHOLDS STAY CONNECTED TO THEIR WORLD, T-MOBILE — THROUGH ASSURANCE WIRELESS, THE UN-CARRIER'S LIFELINE ASSISTANCE BRAND — EXPANDS ITS PARTICIPATION IN THE FEDERAL GOVERNMENT'S AFFORDABLE CONNECTIVITY PROGRAM (ACP) TO SEVEN ADDITIONAL STATES BRINGING THE TOTAL NUMBER WHERE T-MOBILE OFFERS ACP TO 48 STATES AND THE DISTRICT OF COLUMBIA. WITH ACP, ELIGIBLE HOUSEHOLDS CAN GET WHAT THEY NEED TO STAY CONNECTED."}{'symbol': 'TDY', 'date': '2023-02-08 08:01:00', 'title': 'TELEDYNE FLIR DEFENSE WINS $13 MILLION PENTAGON CONTRACT FOR REMOTE CBRN DETECTION USING AUTONOMOUS DRONES', 'text': 'ELKRIDGE, MD.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--TELEDYNE FLIR DEFENSE, PART OF TELEDYNE TECHNOLOGIES INCORPORATED (NYSE:TDY), ANNOUNCED THAT IT HAS BEEN AWARDED A $13.3 MILLION CONTRACT BY THE U.S. DEPARTMENT OF DEFENSE TO FURTHER EXPAND THE CAPABILITIES OF ITS R80D SKYRAIDER™ UNMANNED AERIAL SYSTEM TO AUTONOMOUSLY PERFORM CHEMICAL, BIOLOGICAL, RADIOLOGICAL AND NUCLEAR (CBRN) RECONNAISSANCE MISSIONS.'}{'symbol': 'TSCO', 'date': '2023-02-08 17:02:00', 'title': 'TRACTOR SUPPLY COMPANY ANNOUNCES 12 PERCENT INCREASE IN QUARTERLY DIVIDEND', 'text': 'BRENTWOOD, TENN.'}{'symbol': 'UNH', 'date': '2023-02-08 11:00:00', 'title': 'UNITEDHEALTHCARE INTRODUCES NEW REWARDS PROGRAM WITH A MODERN APPROACH TO WELL-BEING', 'text': 'MINNETONKA, MINN.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--UNITEDHEALTHCARE HAS INTRODUCED UNITEDHEALTHCARE REWARDS, A NEW REWARDS PROGRAM IN WHICH ELIGIBLE MEMBERS, INCLUDING SPOUSES, CAN USE WEARABLE DEVICES TO EARN UP TO $1,000 EACH PER YEAR BY COMPLETING VARIOUS DAILY HEALTH GOALS AND ONE-TIME ACTIVITIES.'}{'symbol': 'VZ', 'date': '2023-02-08 09:00:00', 'title': 'VERIZON GIVES THE FOOTBALL FAN EXPERIENCE A MAJOR UPGRADE HEADING INTO SUPER BOWL LVII', 'text': 'IN ADDITION TO NETWORK ENHANCEMENTS, ACTIVATIONS, AND REGIONAL INVESTMENTS FOR SUPER BOWL LVII, THE NFL HAS TAPPED VERIZON TO SUPPORT CRUCIAL ON-FIELD COACH-TO-COACH COMMUNICATIONS BEGINNING IN 2023 IN ADDITION TO NETWORK ENHANCEMENTS, ACTIVATIONS, AND REGIONAL INVESTMENTS FOR SUPER BOWL LVII, THE NFL HAS TAPPED VERIZON TO SUPPORT CRUCIAL ON-FIELD COACH-TO-COACH COMMUNICATIONS BEGINNING IN 2023'}{'symbol': 'V', 'date': '2023-02-08 07:00:00', 'title': 'VISA ROLLS OUT NEW OFFERS FOR SMALL BUSINESSES', 'text': 'SAN FRANCISCO--