ONS COMPANY, ANNOUNCED THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS APPROVED A REGULAR QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND OF $0.84 PER COMMON SHARE FOR THE QUARTER ENDED DECEMBER 31, 2022. THE DIVIDEND IS PAYABLE ON OR ABOUT APRIL 17, 2023 TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON MARCH 31, 2023.'}{'symbol': 'WYNN', 'date': '2023-02-08 16:02:00', 'title': 'WYNN RESORTS, LIMITED REPORTS FOURTH QUARTER AND YEAR END 2022 RESULTS', 'text': 'LAS VEGAS--(BUSINESS WIRE)--WYNN RESORTS, LIMITED (NASDAQ: WYNN) (THE "COMPANY") TODAY REPORTED FINANCIAL RESULTS FOR THE FOURTH QUARTER AND YEAR ENDED DECEMBER 31, 2022. OPERATING REVENUES WERE $1.00 BILLION FOR THE FOURTH QUARTER OF 2022, A DECREASE OF $48.2 MILLION, FROM $1.05 BILLION FOR THE FOURTH QUARTER OF 2021. NET INCOME ATTRIBUTABLE TO WYNN RESORTS, LIMITED WAS $32.4 MILLION, OR $0.'}